# Raw feature dumps: too large for git in general. Six files under this path are
# tracked anyway (four layers.parquet, two generations.csv) because the paper's
# reproducibility statement points at them; they were added with `git add -f` and
# stay tracked despite this rule. Do not `git rm --cached` this directory.
